			"width": 1600,
			"height": 240,
			"text": "# Home\na small rented cottage bedroom at night in Vermont, a single lamp, a sensible quilt, red maple leaves pressed against the dark window\n\nRight-click a recipe card to make its art; it saves into `screens/home/art/`. Then place it on [[World.canvas]] in the `home` group."
		},
		{
			"id": "g-screen",
			"type": "group",
			"label": "The screen",
